</div></section></section><section id="_adda93_" lang="en" class="data-availability-statement"><h3 class="pmc_sec_title">Data Availability Statement</h3>
<p>Raw and processed proteome data can be found at the ProteomeXchange Consortium via the PRIDE partner repository under the data set identifier <a href="http://proteomecentral.proteomexchange.org/cgi/GetDataset?ID=PXD024933" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PXD024933</a>. This data set has been referenced by Payne et al. (<a href="#B20" class="usa-link" aria-describedby="B20">20</a>).</p></section></section></section><footer class="p courtesy-note font-secondary font-sm text-center"><hr class="headless">
